```
Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "StreetSceneWithPedestrianAndBall" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :EvidenceBasedAnomaly ;
    :hasActor :actor1, :actor2 ;
    :hasEvidence :evidence1, :evidence2 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1, :risk2, :risk3 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 .

:actor1 a :Pedestrian ;
    :description "Person running towards ball on street" .
:actor2 a :Vehicle ;
    :description "Red vehicle approaching from behind" .

:evidence1 a :RollingBallIndicator ;
    :description "Soccer ball rolling on road" ;
    :indicatesPotentialRisk :risk1 .
:evidence2 a :OpenDoorIndicator ;
    :description "Potential door opening anomaly from parked vehicle" ;
    :indicatesPotentialRisk :risk3 .

:weather1 a :ClearCondition ;
    :description "Clear weather with daylight" .

:risk1 a :PedestrianCollisionRisk ;
    :description "Pedestrian may enter vehicle path due to ball" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:risk2 a :RearEndCollisionRisk ;
    :description "Risk of collision with vehicle behind due to sudden stop" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev2 .

:risk3 a :LaneIntrusionRisk ;
    :description "Potential lane intrusion from parked vehicle door" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev3 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.75"^^xsd:float .
:sev2 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.60"^^xsd:float .
:sev3 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.45"^^xsd:float .

Identified Risks for each risk class
Risk 1:
Description: Pedestrian may enter vehicle path due to ball
Severity Score: 0.75

Risk 2:
Description: Risk of collision with vehicle behind due to sudden stop
Severity Score: 0.60

Risk 3:
